      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-16T17:15:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We are definitely going to release free PDFs of errata’d cards on the website, and include correct print versions if we ever print a second edition.  In addition, we are looking on getting updated versions of the cards printed along with our next expansion, but because they will have different backs than any other card in the expansion, that might raise the printing cost too high.</p>",
